}","View my profile":"View my profile","Watchlist Name":"Watchlist Name","Watchlist description.":"Watchlist description.","We're also on \u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbold\u003eiOS and Android\u003c/bold\u003e":"We're also on \u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbold\u003eiOS and Android\u003c/bold\u003e","When the user adds assets, you’ll see them here":"When the user adds assets, you’ll see them here","When you click the star icon on the homepage or other pages the asset will be added to your Main Watchlist":"When you click the star icon on the homepage or other pages the asset will be added to your Main Watchlist","You can only create a max. of 10 Watchlists":"You can only create a max. of 10 Watchlists","You can share the watchlist":"You can share the watchlist","You're not following any watchlists":"You're not following any watchlists","Your watchlist is empty":"Your watchlist is empty","add_coins_to_your_watchlist":"Add Coins to Your Watchlist","followers":"followers","merge_watchlist_info_banner_content":"Merge your logged-out watchlist with your account watchlist","remove":"Remove","save_watchlist_permanently":"Save your watchlist permanently","search_for_more_coins":"Search for More Coins","sign_up_to_save_watchlist_desc":"Sign up to store it in your account, not just your browser.","watchlist_merge_modal_desc":"We’ll combine this with your account’s existing Watchlist(s) \u003c1/\u003eso you can keep track of all these coins and pairs you’ve \u003c1/\u003emarked.","watchlist_merge_modal_title":"You have a local watchlist added while not logged in, want to keep this Watchlist, too?","{{coin}} has been removed from “{{watchlist}}”":"{{coin}} has been removed from “{{watchlist}}”"},"sheet_Watchlist":{"Description (optional)":"Description (optional)","Public":"Public","This is your Main Watchlist":"This is your Main Watchlist","Watchlist description":"Watchlist description","watchlist_cta_button_web":"Start building your crypto watchlist by clicking the button below","watchlist_h1_body_web":"Select the crypto assets that you want to track and create your own watchlist and easily check whether your price targets have been hit. Assets can be added from both our main coin list and also from the 2M+ DEX pairs that we track.","watchlist_h1_web":"Create Your Crypto Watchlist Today","watchlist_new_asset_button_web":"New asset","watchlist_remove_watchlist_sentence_web":"Are you sure you want to remove this watchlist? Any saved coins and tokens will be removed.","watchlist_search_coins_pairs_web":"Search coins or pairs","watchlist_star_icon_text_web":"When you click the star icon on the homepage or on any other page, the asset will be added to your Main Watchlist.","watchlist_text_1_web":"You can keep the Watchlist, but first…","watchlist_text_2_web":"Sign up for a CoinMarketCap account in a few clicks and discover the rapidly growing cryptocurrency space on our world-class price-tracking platform!","watchlist_total_coins_web":"{{count}} coins in total"},"sheet_ai_dexer_common":{},"dexer_landing_revamp":{"1h":"1h","24h":"24h","24h_avg_price_change":"24h Avg Price Change","4h":"4h","5m":"5m","adjust_search_filters":"Try adjusting your search with different filters.","all_chains":"All Chains","all_tokens":"All Tokens","any":"Any","audit_result_pass":"Audit result pass","binance_exclusive_rank_tooltip":"According to the official Binance announcement, token scores are calculated based on a comprehensive evaluation of multiple market indicators, including token price, market cap, transaction activity, and more. Higher scores lead to better token rank, and top-ranked tokens have a chance to be selected for priority listing on Binance Alpha.\u003cbr/\u003eToken rank and score are sourced directly from Binance Wallet. CoinMarketCap makes no commitments regarding any listings.","binance_exclusive_tooltip":"Four Meme – Fair Mode, launched with Four.Meme, lets verified partner wallet users like Trust Wallet and Binance Wallet (Keyless) trade high-potential meme tokens early via a bonding curve model. The experience features three stages—New and Finalizing Stages (non-transferable, rising prices, and exclusive sales), and Listing Stage (potential Binance Alpha listing), with Binance Wallet users also eligible for up to 4× Binance Alpha Points trading volume boosts—while enhancing user protection, reducing bot interference, and promoting active participation in Web3 token launches.","binance_exclusive_tooltip_2":"Four.Meme - X Mode — built for innovation and real players.\u003cbr/\u003eFour.Meme - X Mode is an experimental launch environment where we test new mechanics, fairness models, and anti-bot systems to create a more authentic, human-driven experience.","clear_all":"Clear all","dex_age":"Age","dex_all_networks":"All Networks","dex_landing_description":"Trending DEX tokens that have performed well based on price, volume changes and user popularity in the last 24 hours.","dex_landing_title":"Today's Trending DEX Tokens","dex_liquidity":"Liq","dex_market_cap":"MCap","dex_more":"More","dex_new":"New","dex_search_network":"Search network","dex_search_network_empty":"No matching network found","dex_volume":"Volume","dexscan_buys_web":"Buys","dexscan_fdv_web":"FDV","dexscan_feed":"CMC DexScan Feed","dexscan_feed_description":"This page lists the tokens that have performed well based on price, volume changes and user popularity in the selected window period.","dexscan_filter_modal_title":"Filters","dexscan_holders":"Holders","dexscan_security_scan":"Security Scan","dexscan_sells_web":"Sells","dexscan_txns1h":"1h Txns","dexscan_txns24h":"24h Txns","dexscan_txns4h":"4h Txns","dexscan_txns5m":"5m Txns","dexscan_volumeUsd1h":"1h Vol","dexscan_volumeUsd24h":"24h Vol","dexscan_volumeUsd4h":"4h Vol","dexscan_volumeUsd5m":"5m Vol","dexscan_volume_usd_1h":"1H Vol","edit_filters":"Edit filters","filters_audit_result_pass":"Audit result pass","filters_minimum_social_account":"Minimum 1 social account","graduated_rank":"Graduated Rank","homepage_gainers_web":"Gainers","label_sell_all":"Sell All","losers":"Losers","markket_cap_short":"MC","minimum_value_must_be_less_than_maximum_value":"Minimum value must be less than maximum value","name":"Name","newly_created":"Newly Created","no_results":"No results","num_of_tokens":"# of Tokens","price":"Price ","price_usd":"Price USD","security_scan_pass":"Security Scan Pass","total_mc":"Total MC","total_vol":"Total Vol","vol":"Vol","whats_binance_exclusive":"What's Four Meme - Fair Mode?","whats_binance_exclusive_2":"What's Four.Meme - X Mode?"},"community_social":{"Mindshare":"Mindshare","Sentiment":"Sentiment","cdp_social_panel_24h_mindshare":"24h Mindshare","cdp_social_panel_24h_sentiment":"24h Sentiment","cdp_social_panel_bearish":"Bearish","cdp_social_panel_bullish":"Bullish","cdp_social_panel_gtm_tab_influencers":"Influencers","cdp_social_panel_log_in_and_post":"Log in and post","cdp_social_panel_mindshare":"Mindshare","cdp_social_panel_no_influencers_found":"No influencers found","cdp_social_panel_no_social_data_available":"No social data available for this token","cdp_social_panel_no_social_data_available_short":"No social data available","cdp_social_panel_post":"Post","cdp_social_panel_see_all":"See All","cdp_social_panel_see_more":"See More","cdp_social_panel_show_more":"Show more","cdp_social_panel_social_insights":"Social Insights","cdp_social_panel_tab_for_you":"For You","cdp_social_panel_tab_mindshare":"Mindshare","cdp_social_panel_voted":"Voted","community_badge_aggregated_by_coinmarketcap":"Aggregated by CoinMarketCap","community_toast_commonerror":"Oops! Looks like something went wrong. Please try again later.","fear_and_greed_card_neutral":"Neutral","insights_chart_insights_range":"Insights range","insights_chart_label_bearish":"Bearish","insights_chart_label_bullish":"Bullish","insights_chart_legend_price":"Price","insights_chart_loading_chart":"Loading chart","insights_chart_timeframe_24h":"24h","insights_chart_timeframe_30d":"30d","insights_chart_timeframe_7d":"7d","insights_chart_toggle_chart_metric":"Chart metric","post_detail_add_a_comment":"Add a comment...","post_detail_comment":"Comment","post_detail_commenting":"Commenting...","post_detail_comments":"Comments","post_detail_no_comments_yet":"No comments yet","post_detail_no_reposts_yet":"No Reposts yet","post_detail_post_detail":"Post detail","post_detail_reposts":"Reposts","sentiment_yearly_start_tooltip":"Social sentiment tracked since {{date}}","social_metrics_all_posts_and_insights":"All Posts \u0026 Insights","social_metrics_analytic_depth":"Analytical Depth","social_metrics_analytic_depth_explainer":"Measures content quality — based on recency, relevancy, post quality score, and content type over the past 30 days.","social_metrics_depth_score":"Depth Score","social_metrics_influence_score":"Influence Score","social_metrics_kol_mindshare":"KOL Mindshare","social_metrics_kol_mindshare_explainer":"KOL influence is measured across two dimensions — Social Influence and Analytical Depth. Toggle between both to view a KOL's corresponding score.","social_metrics_mindshare_column_explainer":"Mindshare measures how much attention and discussion a crypto project is generating from influencers and official accounts, based on social media mentions and engagement.","social_metrics_neutral":"Neutral","social_metrics_price":"Price","social_metrics_read_more":"Read more","social_metrics_sentiment_by_timeframe":"{{timeframe}} Sentiment","social_metrics_sentiment_column_explainer":"Social Sentiment is scored on a scale from -10.00 to 10.00 and reflects the overall tone of social discussions, ranging from negative to positive.","social_metrics_social_influence":"Social Influence","social_metrics_social_influence_explainer":"Measures a KOL's reach and amplification — based on follower count, follower quality, impressions, and engagement over the past 7 days.","social_metrics_social_insights":"Social Insights","social_metrics_token_mindshare":"Token Mindshare","social_metrics_token_mindshare_explainer":"Reflects how much an influencer is driving discussion around a token — weighted 70% on Social Influence and 30% on Analytical Depth.","social_metrics_top_influencers_explainer":"Top influencers are the creators generating the most mindshare for crypto projects, ranked by their mentions and engagement.","social_post_auto_sync":"Auto-Sync","social_post_bearish":"Bearish","social_post_bullish":"Bullish","social_post_followers_count":"{{count}} Followers","social_post_more":"More","social_post_read_all":"Read all","social_post_this_account_has_been_deleted":"This account has been deleted","social_post_this_post_is_synced_from_x":"This post is synced from X automatically.","social_post_twitter_followers":"Twitter followers","social_profile_24h_sentiment":"24h Sentiment","social_profile_account":"Account","social_profile_all_articles":"All Articles","social_profile_all_comments":"All Comments","social_profile_all_posts":"All Posts","social_profile_all_reactions":"All Reactions","social_profile_analytics":"Analytics","social_profile_announcement":"Announcement","social_profile_article":"Article","social_profile_articles":"Articles","social_profile_block":"Block","social_profile_bullish":"Bullish","social_profile_clipboard_not_supported":"Clipboard not supported in your browser","social_profile_close":"Close","social_profile_cmc_community_metrics":"CMC Community Metrics","social_profile_comments":"Comments","social_profile_copied":"Copied!","social_profile_create_first_watchlist":"Create My First Watchlist","social_profile_delete":"Delete","social_profile_disclaimer":"Disclaimer","social_profile_disclaimer_here":"here","social_profile_disclaimer_p1":"The content displayed on this page is sourced from publicly available posts on third-party platforms, including X (formerly Twitter). All content remains the intellectual property of its respective authors and is attributed accordingly. CoinMarketCap does not claim ownership over any third-party content.","social_profile_disclaimer_p3_prefix":"If you are an individual whose content appears on this page and you wish to request content removal, data deletion, or access to your profile, please contact us","social_profile_disclaimer_p3_suffix":". We will respond to all requests within [30] days.","social_profile_edit":"Edit","social_profile_edit_cover":"Edit profile cover","social_profile_edit_watchlist":"Edit watchlist","social_profile_empty_no_project_articles":"This project hasn't posted any articles. Explore what else is happening now!","social_profile_empty_no_public_posts":"This profile does not have any public posts to display right now.","social_profile_empty_no_scheduled_posts":"You have no scheduled posts. Create a new post and choose a time to publish.","social_profile_empty_nothing_here_yet":"Nothing here yet","social_profile_empty_nothing_here_yet_title":"Nothing Here Yet","social_profile_empty_post_first_or_discover":"You can post your first post, or discover and repost accounts you are interested in!","social_profile_engagements":"Engagements","social_profile_failed_to_copy":"Failed to copy!","social_profile_follow":"Follow","social_profile_followers":"Followers","social_profile_following":"Following","social_profile_impressions":"Impressions","social_profile_more_actions":"More actions","social_profile_new_article":"New Article","social_profile_new_post":"New Post","social_profile_no_data_available":"No data available","social_profile_no_more_data":"No more data","social_profile_other_influencers":"Other Influencers","social_profile_pin_watchlists":"Pin my Watchlists","social_profile_posts":"Posts","social_profile_preview_cover":"Preview profile cover","social_profile_published_posts":"Published Posts","social_profile_reactions":"Reactions","social_profile_refresh":"Refresh","social_profile_report":"Report","social_profile_reschedule":"Reschedule","social_profile_scheduled":"Scheduled","social_profile_scheduled_posts":"Scheduled Posts","social_profile_see_all":"See All","social_profile_share_profile":"Share Profile","social_profile_this_profile_has_no_bio_yet":"This profile has no bio yet.","social_profile_token_filter_crypto":"Crypto","social_profile_token_mentions":"Token Mentions","social_profile_unavailable_blocked_description":"You cannot access this profile right now.","social_profile_unavailable_blocked_title":"This profile is unavailable","social_profile_unavailable_deleted_description":"The profile is no longer available.","social_profile_unavailable_deleted_title":"This account has been deleted","social_profile_unavailable_not_found_description":"Try another handle or come back later if the profile was recently created.","social_profile_unavailable_not_found_title":"This account does not exist","social_profile_unavailable_suspended_description":"We suspend accounts that violate our rules of service.","social_profile_unavailable_suspended_title":"Account suspended","social_profile_unavailable_unavailable_description":"Please try again later.","social_profile_unavailable_unavailable_title":"This profile is unavailable","social_profile_unavailable_user_blocked_description":"Unblock @{{username}} to view their posts and articles.","social_profile_unavailable_user_blocked_title":"You've blocked this user","social_profile_unavailable_user_blocked_you_description":"You cannot follow @{{username}} or view their posts and articles.","social_profile_unavailable_user_blocked_you_title":"Sorry, this account is private.","social_profile_users_watchlist":"{{name}}'s Watchlist","social_profile_view_this_watchlist":"View this Watchlist","social_profile_what_are_people_saying":"What are people saying?","social_scheduled_post_post_successfully_scheduled":"Your post is successfully scheduled.","social_scheduled_post_scheduled_time_in_past":"The post's scheduled time is in the past. No further amendments can be done.","social_top_influencers":"Top Influencers","social_top_tooltip":"Top influencers are the creators generating the most mindshare for crypto projects, ranked by their mentions and engagement.","social_vibe_card_todays_discussions":"Today's Discussions","social_vibe_card_view_less":"View Less","social_vibe_card_view_more":"View More"},"homepage":{"homepage_seo_text":"\u003ch2\u003eToday’s Cryptocurrency Prices, Charts and Data\u003c/h2\u003e \u003cp\u003e Welcome to CoinMarketCap.com! This site was founded in May 2013 by Brandon Chez to provide up-to-date cryptocurrency prices, charts and data about the emerging cryptocurrency markets. Since then, the world of blockchain and cryptocurrency has grown exponentially and we are very proud to have grown with it. We take our data very seriously and we do not change our data to fit any narrative: we stand for accurately, timely and unbiased information. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch2\u003eAll Your Crypto Market Data Needs in One Place\u003c/h2\u003e \u003cp\u003e Here at CoinMarketCap, we work very hard to ensure that all the relevant and \u003ca target=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/community/articles/\"\u003eup-to-date information\u003c/a\u003e about cryptocurrencies, coins and tokens can be located in one easily discoverable place. From the very first day, the goal was for the site to be the number one location online for crypto market data, and we work hard to empower our users with our unbiased and accurate information. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eWe Provide Live and Historic Crypto Charts for Free\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e Each of our coin data pages has a graph that shows both the current and historic price information for the coin or token. Normally, the graph starts at the launch of the asset, but it is possible to select specific to and from dates to customize the chart to your own needs. These charts and their information are free to visitors of our website. \u003cbr\u003e The most experienced and professional traders often choose to use the \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/api/\"\u003ebest crypto API\u003c/a\u003e on the market. Our API enables millions of calls to track current prices and to also investigate historic prices and is used by some of the largest crypto exchanges and financial institutions in the world. \u003cbr\u003e CoinMarketCap also provides data about the \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/dexscan/top-traders/all/\"\u003emost successful traders\u003c/a\u003e for you to monitor. We also provide data about the \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/trending-cryptocurrencies/\"\u003elatest trending cryptos\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/dexscan/trending/all/\"\u003etrending DEX pairs\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eHow Do We Calculate Our Cryptocurrency Prices?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e We receive updated cryptocurrency prices directly from many exchanges based on their pairs. We then convert the number to USD. A full explanation can be found \u003ca href=\"https://support.coinmarketcap.com/hc/en-us/articles/360043395752-Price-Market-Pair-Cryptoasset-\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e Related Links \u003cbr /\u003e Are you ready to learn more? Visit our \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/academy/glossary\"\u003eglossary\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/academy\"\u003ecrypto learning\u003c/a\u003e center. \u003cbr\u003e Are you interested in the scope of crypto assets? Investigate our list of \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/cryptocurrency-category/\"\u003ecryptocurrency categories.\u003c/a\u003e \u003cbr\u003eAre you interested in knowing which the \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/hot-dex-pairs/\"\u003ehottest dex pairs\u003c/a\u003e are currently? \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003e How Do We Calculate Our Crypto Valuations?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e We calculate our valuations based on the total circulating supply of an asset multiplied by the currency reference price. The topic is explained in more detail \u003ca href=\"https://support.coinmarketcap.com/hc/en-us/articles/360043836811-Market-Capitalization-Cryptoasset-Aggregate-\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eHow Do We Calculate the Cryptocurrency Market Cap?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e We calculate the total cryptocurrency market capitalization as the sum of all cryptocurrencies listed on the site. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch2\u003eDoes CoinMarketCap.com List All Cryptocurrencies?\u003c/h2\u003e \u003cp\u003e Almost. We have a process that we use to verify assets. Once verified, we create a coin description page \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/\"\u003elike this\u003c/a\u003e. The world of crypto now contains many coins and tokens that we feel unable to verify. In those situations, our \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/dexscan/networks/ethereum/\"\u003eDexscan\u003c/a\u003e product lists them automatically by taking on-chain data for newly created smart contracts. We do not cover every chain, but at the time of writing we track the top 70 crypto chains, which means that we list more than 97% of all tokens. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eHow Big Is the Global Coin Market?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e At the time of writing, we estimate that there are more than 2 million pairs being traded, made up of coins, tokens and projects in the global coin market. As mentioned above, we have a \u003ca href=\"https://support.coinmarketcap.com/hc/en-us/articles/360043659351-Listings-Criteria\"\u003edue diligence process\u003c/a\u003e that we apply to new coins before they are listed. This process controls how many of the cryptocurrencies from the global market are represented on our site. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003e What Is an Altcoin?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e The very first cryptocurrency was \u003ca href='https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/' target='_blank'\u003e Bitcoin\u003c/a\u003e. Since it is open source, it is possible for other people to use the majority of the code, make a few changes and then launch their own separate currency. Many people have done exactly this. Some of these coins are very similar to Bitcoin, with just one or two amended features (such as \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/litecoin/\"\u003eLitecoin\u003c/a\u003e), while others are very different, with varying models of security, issuance and governance. However, they all share the same moniker — every coin issued after Bitcoin is considered to be an altcoin. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003e What Is a Smart Contract?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e The first chain to launch \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/academy/article/what-is-a-smart-contract\"\u003esmart contracts\u003c/a\u003e was \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/\"\u003eEthereum\u003c/a\u003e. A smart contract enables multiple scripts to engage with each other using clearly defined rules, to execute on tasks which can become a coded form of a contract. They have revolutionized the digital asset space because they have enabled decentralized exchanges, decentralized finance, ICOs, IDOs and much more. A huge proportion of the value created and stored in cryptocurrency is enabled by smart contracts. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003e What Is a Stablecoin?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e Price volatility has long been one of the features of the cryptocurrency market. When asset prices move quickly in either direction and the market itself is relatively thin, it can sometimes be difficult to conduct transactions as might be needed. To overcome this problem, a new type of cryptocurrency tied in value to existing currencies — ranging from the U.S. dollar, other fiats or even other cryptocurrencies — arose. These new cryptocurrency are known as \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/academy/glossary/stablecoin\"\u003establecoins\u003c/a\u003e, and they can be used for a multitude of purposes due to their stability. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eWhat Is an NFT?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003eNFTs are multi-use images that are stored on a blockchain. They can be used as art, a way to share QR codes, ticketing and many more things. The first breakout use was for art, with projects like \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/nft/collections/eth/0xb47e3cd837ddf8e4c57f05d70ab865de6e193bbb/CryptoPunks/\"\u003eCryptoPunks\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/nft/collections/eth/0xbc4ca0eda7647a8ab7c2061c2e118a18a936f13d/BoredApeYachtClub/\"\u003eBored Ape Yacht Club\u003c/a\u003e gaining large followings. We also list all of the \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/nft/\"\u003etop NFT collections\u003c/a\u003e available, including the related \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/view/collectibles-nfts/\"\u003eNFT coins\u003c/a\u003e and tokens.. We collect latest sale and transaction data, plus \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/nft/upcoming/\"\u003eupcoming NFT collection launches\u003c/a\u003e onchain. NFTs are a new and innovative part of the crypto ecosystem that have the potential to change and update many business models for the \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/academy/glossary/web-3-0\"\u003eWeb 3\u003c/a\u003e world. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eWhat Are In-game Tokens?\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://coinmarketcap.com/alexandria/glossary/play2earn-play-to-earn\\\"\u003ePlay-to-earn\u003c/a\u003e (P2E) games, also known as \u003ca href=\\\"https://coinmarketcap.com/alexandria/glossary/gamefi\\\"\u003eGameFi\u003c/a\u003e, has emerged as an extremely popular category in the crypto space. It combines \u003ca href=\\\"https://coinmarketcap.com/alexandria/glossary/non-fungible-token\\\"\u003enon-fungible tokens\u003c/a\u003e (NFT), in-game crypto tokens, \u003ca href=\\\"https://coinmarketcap.com/alexandria/glossary/defi\\\"\u003edecentralized finance\u003c/a\u003e (DeFi) elements and sometimes even metaverse applications. Players have an opportunity to generate revenue by giving their time (and sometimes capital) and playing these games.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eOne of the biggest winners is \u003ca href=\\\"https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/axie-infinity/\\\"\u003eAxie Infinity\u003c/a\u003e — a Pokémon-inspired game where players collect Axies (NFTs of digital pets), breed and battle them against other players to earn Smooth Love Potion (SLP) — the in-game reward token. This game was extremely popular in developing countries like The Philippines, due to the level of income they could earn. Players in the Philippines can check the price of \u003ca href=\\\"https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/smooth-love-potion/slp/php/\\\"\u003eSLP to PHP today\u003c/a\u003e directly on CoinMarketCap.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eWhat Are ETFs?\u003c/3\u003e \u003cp\u003eIn January 2024 the SEC approved 11 \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/academy/glossary/exchange-traded-fund-etf\"\u003eexchange traded funds\u003c/a\u003e to invest in Bitcoin. There were already a number of \u003ca href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/bitcoin-etf/\"\u003eBitcoin ETFs\u003c/a\u003e available in other countries, but this change allowed them to be available to retail investors in the United States. This opens the way for a much wider range of investors to be able to add some exposure to cryptocurrency in their portfolios.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch2\u003eWhich Is the Best Cryptocurrency to Invest in? \u003c/h2\u003e \u003cp\u003e CoinMarketCap does not offer financial or investment advice about which cryptocurrency, token or asset does or does not make a good investment, nor do we offer advice about the timing of purchases or sales. We are strictly a data company. \u003cbr /\u003e Please remember that the prices, yields and values of financial assets change. This means that any capital you may invest is at risk. We recommend seeking the advice of a professional investment advisor for guidance related to your personal circumstances. \u003c/p\u003e \u003ch3\u003eIf You Are Investing in Cryptocurrency — CoinMarketCap.com Is for You\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003e TThe data at CoinMarketCap updates every few seconds, which means that it is possible to check in on the value of your investments and assets at any time and from anywhere in the world. We look forward to seeing you regularly! \u003c/p\u003e"},"common":{" We are modest about our success.":" We are modest about our success.","# Coins":"# Coins","# Markets":"# Markets","% 1h":"% 1h","% 24h":"% 24h","% 7d":"% 7d","% Change":"% Change","% Mkt Share":"% Mkt Share","% of Supply in Circlulation":"% of Supply in Circlulation","% of Total Supply":"% of Total Supply","(you)":"(you)","* If you don’t see it in Inbox, try the Junk Mail/Spam folder. Otherwise, make sure you entered the same e-mail address you used to sign in.":"* If you don’t see it in Inbox, try the Junk Mail/Spam folder. Otherwise, make sure you entered the same e-mail address you used to sign in.","* Not Mineable":"* Not Mineable","* Price Excluded":"* Price Excluded","* Username can only be changed once per 7 days":"* Username can only be changed once per 7 days","** Volume Excluded":"** Volume Excluded","*** Price/Volume Excluded - Outlier Detected":"*** Price/Volume Excluded - Outlier Detected","+2% Depth":"+2% Depth","-2% Depth":"-2% Depth","1 Filter Active":"1 Filter Active","1 More Filter":"1 More Filter","1 hour ago":"1 hour ago","1 minute ago":"1 minute ago","15m":"15m","1D":"1D","1M":"1M","1Y":"1Y","1d":"1d","1d change(TVL)":"1d change (TVL)","1h":"1h","1h %":"1h %","1h% in BTC":"1h% in BTC","1h% in ETH":"1h% in ETH","1m":"1m","1m Low / High":"1m Low / High","1y":"1y","1y Low / High":"1y Low / High","20 coins is as far as we can go, buddy.":"20 coins is as far as we can go, buddy.","24 Hour Volume Rankings (Currency)":"24 Hour Volume Rankings (Currency)","24H":"24h","24h":"24h","24h %":"24h %","24h Chart":"24h Chart","24h Low / 24h High":"24h Low / 24h High","24h Low / High":"24h Low / High","24h Txns":"24h Txn