 order. To reorder the list, just click on one of the column headers, for example, 7d, and the list will be reordered to show the highest or lowest coins first.":"They are listed with the largest token by market capitalization first and then in descending order. To reorder the list, just click on one of the column headers, for example, 7d, and the list will be reordered to show the highest or lowest coins first.","This Email account has already been bound to another Wallet account.":"This Email account has already been bound to another Wallet account.","This Key will allow you to recover your Authenticator if you lose your phone. Otherwise, resetting Google Authenticator will take at least 7 days.":"This Key will allow you to recover your Authenticator if you lose your phone. Otherwise, resetting Google Authenticator will take at least 7 days.","This Twitter account is currently linked to another CMC user. Please link another Twitter account.":"This Twitter account is currently linked to another CMC user. Please link another Twitter account.","This Wallet has already been bound to another Email account.":"This Wallet has already been bound to another Email account.","This list does not imply endorsement by CoinMarketCap. There might be Smart Contract risk and IL risk. Please Do Your Own Research before investing on any farming project.":"This list does not imply endorsement by CoinMarketCap. There might be Smart Contract risk and IL risk. Please Do Your Own Research before investing on any farming project.","This page lists cryptocurrencies and tokens related to digital storage listed in order by market cap.":"This page lists cryptocurrencies and tokens related to digital storage listed in order by market cap.","This page lists the top 100 cryptocurrency coins by market cap.":"This page lists the top 100 cryptocurrency coins by market cap.","This page lists the top 100 cryptocurrency tokens by market cap.":"This page lists the top 100 cryptocurrency tokens by market